    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T08:03:29Z",
    "body": "Thank you very much for the report — we’ll fix this as soon as possible.\nThe issue is due to the recent release of Qiskit 2.0 and the associated update of qiskit-ibm-runtime.\nDowngrading qiskit-ibm-runtime should resolve the issue for now, but we’ll update the requirements accordingly.\n\n",
