    "updated_at": "2025-04-07T08:42:27Z",
    "body": "Hey @eburnette,\nthanks again for the report. This should've been fixed in #325 which has already been merged to the develop branch. Your example works for me if I install in a new python venv with the develop branch. We will release a new version of squlearn very soon. Until then you could try working with the develop branch. Let us know if you encounter any further issues.\n\nCheers Moritz",
